Dear all,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m still stuck with phylogenetic analysis.</div><div><br></div><div>First, I do mean shapes using the function:</div><div><br></div><div>Lisso.means&lt;-lapply(coords.subset(gdf$shape, classifier$Species), FUN = mshape)<br>Lisso.means1&lt;-as.matrix(Lisso.means)<br><br></div><div>When I list out dimnames they are sorted alphabetically </div><div><br></div><div>dimnames(Lisso.means1)<br></div><div><p style="margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm">[1]
&quot;Lissotriton_boscai&quot;     
&quot;Lissotriton_graecus&quot;    
&quot;Lissotriton_helveticus&quot; 
&quot;Lissotriton_montandoni&quot; </span></p>

<span style="font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm">[5] &quot;Lissotriton_schmidtleri&quot; &quot;Lissotriton_vulgaris</span><br></div><div><br></div><div>I need the taxa to be sorted as in the tree.</div><div><br></div><div>I tried function:</div><div><br></div><div>identical (dimnames (Lisso.means1), LissoPhy$tip.label)<br></div><div><br></div><div>which reports FALSE</div><div><br></div><div>Then I tried to make a new order vector:</div><div><br></div><div>newOrder &lt;- match (LissoPhy$tip.label, dimnames (Lisso.means1)[[1]])<br></div><div><br></div><div>and</div><div><br></div><div>Lisso.means2&lt;-Lisso.means1[newOrder, drop=FALSE]<br></div><div><br></div><div>This reorders the species means as it should, but loses dimension names despite drop=FALSE.</div><div>So there&#39;s nothing to match.</div><div><br></div><div>Then, I tried to name dimensions manually</div><div><br></div><div>Lisso.means3&lt;-as.matrix(Lisso.means2)<br></div><div>my_dimensions&lt;-list(c(&quot;Lissotriton_vulgaris&quot;, &quot;Lissotriton_schmidtleri&quot;, &quot;Lissotriton_graecus&quot;, &quot;Lissotriton_montandoni&quot;, &quot;Lissotriton_helveticus&quot;, &quot;Lissotriton_boscai&quot;))<br>dimnames(Lisso.means3)&lt;-my_dimensions<br></div><div><br></div><div>Which works</div><div><br></div><div>But for the function:</div><div><br></div><div>identical (dimnames (Lisso.means3), LissoPhy$tip.label)<br></div><div><br></div><div>I get FALSE again despite taxa being in the same order</div><div><br></div><div><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue">&gt; </span><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue">LissoPhy$tip</span></span><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm"><span style="outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap">[1] </span></span></span></div><div><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm"><span style="outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap">&quot;Lissotriton_vulgaris&quot;    &quot;Lissotriton_schmidtleri&quot; &quot;Lissotriton_graecus&quot;     &quot;Lissotriton_montandoni&quot; </span></span></span></div><div><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm">[5] &quot;Lissotriton_helveticus&quot;  &quot;Lissotriton_boscai&quot;    </span></span></div><div><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm"></span></span><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue">&gt; </span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue">dimnames(Lisso.means3)</span></span></div><div><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm"><span style="outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap">[[1]]</span></span></span></div><div><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm">[1] &quot;Lissotriton_vulgaris&quot;    &quot;Lissotriton_schmidtleri&quot; &quot;Lissotriton_graecus&quot;     &quot;Lissotriton_montandoni&quot; </span></span></div><div><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm">[5] &quot;Lissotriton_helveticus&quot;  &quot;Lissotriton_boscai&quot;     </span></span></div><div><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm"> </span></span><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm">[[2]]</span></span><span style="line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all"><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm">NULL</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black"></span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>However, I noticed that I have a &quot;NULL&quot; dimension in my mean shape data. </div><div><br></div><div>I probably missed a step again. </div><div><br></div><div>All the best,</div><div>Aleksandar</div>
